  read_side ==>|bind| owned_memory_ledger
  owned_memory_ledger <-->|call| react_loop
  react_loop -.->|requests write| fail_closed_gate
  fail_closed_gate -.->|trace| governance
  governance ==>|reviewed feedback| owned_memory_ledger
  sources --> normalize
  normalize --> owned_records
  owned_records --> read_side
  policy_router <--> owned_memory_ledger
  owned_memory_ledger <--> converse
  react_loop -->|expand| reason
  reason --> act
  act --> observe
  observe --> reflect
  side_effect_intent --> procedure_manifest
  procedure_manifest --> policy_check
  policy_check --> fail_closed_gate
  fail_closed_gate --> execute_refuse
  governance -->|expand| run_traces
  run_traces --> extract
  extract --> review
  review --> promote
  promote --> deploy
